#: application/views/mail/inviting.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"My name is %2$s, I'm the Video Division Head of the largest international wedding photographers community MyWed: <a href=\"%3$s\" %4$s>mywed.com</a><br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"We are currently getting ready to launch a similar project for videographers and we are looking for feedback from seasoned professionals of the videography industry. May we ask you to help us?<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"We don't require any obligations: all you'll need is just to try the website features and, if you feel like it, let us know if something is wrong or if something can be perfected. If you decide not to provide your feedback or if everything is fine, you won't have to contact us (but we will be very pleased if you do).<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"In return, we are ready to give you a Pro account for one year: it gives you a priority position in the directory and many other advantages.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Once again, there are no obligations: if you don't want to give feedback, you are free not to do that.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"If you are interested, just email me back.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"With best wishes,<br>\n"
"%2$s,<br>\n"
"Video Division Head"
msgstr ""

