#: application/views/mail/to-grabbed-users.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "<p>Hi, %1$s,<br>\n"
"I'm %2$s, and I've found your wedding photography portfolio on Facebook in %3$s.<br>\n"
"I'm a project manager of the MyWed wedding photographers directory: <a href=\"https://mywed.com\" target=\"_blank\">mywed.com</a> (the world's first largest wedding photography website with more than %4$s members).</p>\n"
"<p>You see, I'm currently looking for photographers in %5$s, and I think your portfolio is worth being listed in the directory of %3$s. </p>\n"
"<p>On MyWed, you can keep up to %6$s photos and %7$s photo series absolutely free. Browsing the directory, couples contact photographers directly, without any interference from our side. You may follow the world-renowned wedding photographers, get inspired by thousands of refined and artistic photos and participate in international contests. Just to let you know: MyWed membership is free. It is, it was and it will always be!</p>\n"
"<p>I have tried to compose a draft of your personal page so that you don't have to waste your time on it 🙂  You can personalize it the way you like or delete it at any moment.<br>\n"
"Currently, this page is invisible to everyone and is available by this secret link only: %8$s</p>\n"
"<p>If you agree to join MyWed and make your portfolio visible in the directory, you just need to follow the link, check if I completed everything properly and click on 'Yes, publish it' button on the blue bar at the bottom of the page.<br>\n"
"If you don't want to include your portfolio in the directory and wish to delete the draft permanently, just click on the 'No, delete it' button. I will immediately delete the draft myself.</p>\n"
"<p>But I'd be really glad if you decide to join 🙂 </p> \n"
"<p>Thank you for your time, don't hesitate to ask any questions, I'll be happy to answer them.</p> \n"
"<p>With best wishes,<br>\n"
"%9$s,<br>\n"
"Project manager<br>\n"
"<a href=\"https://mywed.com\" target=\"_blank\">mywed.com</a><img src=\"%10$s\" alt=\" \" height=\"1px\"/></p>"
msgstr ""

