#: application/views/private_messages/categories.phtml:1
#: application/views/private_messages/categories2.phtml:1
msgid "One small step for MyWed, one giant leap for the whole photographers’ community! :) This may not sound very modest but, honestly, it is a really significant development for us. We were planning such transformation to be performed in a couple of years but the coronacrisis made adjustments to the plan, and we have dared to make it now. Probably, it’s for the best :) The previous year was not easy but it was exactly what inspired us to the radical changes."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/categories.phtml:2
#: application/views/private_messages/categories2.phtml:3
msgid "From now on, MyWed is a website not for wedding photographers only but for family photographers as well!"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/private_messages/categories.phtml:2
msgid "We have become witnesses of an unprecedented crisis in the wedding industry caused by COVID-19. Many talented photographers stopped doing what they love and lost the source of income for their families.\n\n"
"Of course, it will not be like that forever. We are certain that sooner or later the quarantine will end and the world will return to its routine course. However, there is still a chance that weddings might be prohibited for some time.\n\n"
"We understand that not all of you can wait, so we have decided to go for radical changes to let the website cover other topics: kids, family, portrait photography, vacation and travel photo shoots.\n\n"
"If you already work in these fields, you can now create a relevant portfolio on MyWed. If not, maybe it's the right time to try, as a talented person is talented in everything : )"
msgstr "We have become witnesses of an unprecedented crisis in the wedding industry caused by COVID-19. Many talented photographers stopped doing what they love and lost the source of income for their families.\n\n"
"Of course, it will not be like that forever. We are confident that this year the quarantine will end and the world will return to its routine course. However, there is still a chance that weddings might be prohibited for some time.\n\n"
"We understand that not all of you can wait, so we have decided to go for radical changes to let the website cover other topics: kids, family and portrait photography.\n\n"
"If you already work in these fields, you can now create a relevant portfolio on MyWed. If not, maybe it's the right time to try, as a talented person is talented in everything : )"

