#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/newlyweds.phtml:2
#, php-format
msgid "Please kindly note some important things about the MyWed website:\n\n"
"The photographers' catalogue can be found here: %s. Choose your country or city, set the preferred price range and you will see a list of local photographers.\n\n"
"Each photographer in the catalogue is sorted according to the rating he or she has. The rating is formed according to the votes made by other photographers and the results of MyWed competitions judged by independent jurors.\n"
"That's why it is true to facts and showing the professional level of each photographer. By clicking on the name of a photographer you will open the personal profile page where you can see achievements such MyWed Award contest victories or Editors' Choice marks.\n\n"
"All MyWed members are independent photographers with their own photo shoot packages and charges.\n"
"Because you choose and book photographers by yourself without any intermediary agents we recommend that you do your correspondence on the MyWed website solely otherwise we won't be able to help you out with any controversial issue you might encounter.\n\n"
"Please feel free to contact us in case you have any questions."
msgstr "Please kindly note some important things about the MyWed website:\n\n"
"The photographers' catalogue can be found here: %s. Choose your country or city, set the preferred price range and you will see a list of local photographers.\n\n"
"Each photographer in the catalogue is sorted according to the rating he or she has. The rating is formed according to the votes made by other photographers and the results of MyWed competitions judged by independent jurors.\n\n"
"That's why it is true to facts and showing the professional level of each photographer. By clicking on the name of a photographer you will open the personal profile page where you can see achievements such MyWed Award contest victories or Editors' Choice marks.\n\n"
"All MyWed members are independent photographers with their own photo shoot packages and charges.\n\n"
"Because you choose and book photographers by yourself without any intermediary agents we recommend that you do your correspondence on the MyWed website solely otherwise we won't be able to help you out with any controversial issue you might encounter.\n\n"
"Please feel free to contact us in case you have any questions."

