#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:62
msgid "Yves Scheppers"
msgstr "Yves Schepers"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:63
msgid "A lover of good food, Belgian beer, photography, a bearded man and a father of 2 kids. Besides, Dries is the winner of the \"Details\" nomination of the MyWed Award in 2017. As a former graphic designer, he is always searching for a fresh angle, lines and a vantage point to create a modernistic graphic and geometric photographic style."
msgstr "A lover of good food, Belgian beer, photography, a bearded man and a father of 2 kids. Besides, Dries is the winner of the \"Details\" nomination of the MyWed Award in 2017.<br>As a former graphic designer, he is always searching for a fresh angle, lines and a vantage point to create a modernistic graphic and geometric photographic style."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:64
msgid "A fan of superheroes comics, cartoons and Lego, and a wedding photographer based in Tuscany, Italy. Top 5 WPJA 2014 – 2016, Top 5 ISPWP in 2016 and 2017, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2017 and Italian photographer of the year by ANFM in 2017."
msgstr "A fan of superheroes comics, cartoons and Lego, and a wedding photographer based in Tuscany, Italy. Top 5 WPJA<br>2014 – 2016, Top 5 ISPWP in 2016 and 2017, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2017 and Italian photographer of the year by ANFM in 2017."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:65
msgid "Currently, the best photographer in the UK according to MyWed. He was ranked the 1st photographer in the UK by Fearless Photographers in 2016, 2017 and by WPS in 2015, 2016. Among his other accolades: Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2016, Top 5 Wedding Photojournalist by MyMemory in 2017, and Best Wedding Photographer North West by TWIA in 2015."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:66
msgid "Outstanding photo shooter from Indonesia, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2015 and 2016, ISPWP Photographer of the Quarter in 2015, Top 10 in 2015 and 2017. Hendra was the winner of Junebug Best of the Best Destination and Best of the Best Weddings in 2015, and a jury member of the Junebug Best of the Best Engagement in 2016 and of the 7th round of Master of Dutch Wedding Photography."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:67
msgid "Photographer of the Year by MyWed in 2017. Ken's sense of humour and vivacity are the main foundations for the emergence of his unique photographic style. The key credentials are Top 10 WPJA and WPS Photographer in 2017, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2016, Rangefinder and Junebug Best of the Best awards."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:68
msgid "It is noteworthy that Jorge is a graphic designer, and the combination of the photographer's and the designer's skills allows him to create pixel-perfect images full of sincerity and artistic sophistication. The best Mexican photographer according to MyWed, he was honoured for the results of the MyWed Award in the previous years and is frequently awarded by ISPWP."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:69
msgid "Pavel has an eye for detail, and he knows fairly well when it is the right time to press the shutter. He was the finalist of three MyWed Award categories and currently has 4 Fearless Awards, being honoured by SLR Lounge as well. Pavel believes that one should incessantly work on self-enhancement to deliver top-grade photos to the customers."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:70
msgid "Candid photojournalism addict. He ranked the 4th best score in the Best Wedding Story category of the MyWed Award in 2017. Besides, he collaborates with White Sposa, Wedding Magazine and other publishing companies."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:71
msgid "Rising star in the wedding photography industry. With only 4 years into the game, he is named the Best Wedding Photographer of Belgium, Netherlands & Luxembourg by Masters of Wedding Photography in 2017, Top 10 of BeNeLux in 2015 and 2016, and Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2017."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:85
msgid "Sara is a member of numerous associations and a winner of international and national contests by Fearless, ISPWP, MyWed and ANFM. She was the master of photography at the ProWedding Campus in Naples and a judge of the Romanian photographers' contest \"100 Fotografii de Nunta\" in 2018. She is constantly looking for a shoot with a strong emotive and creative impact."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:86
msgid "Cake eating, dog loving, wedding-obsessed chaser of emotions, moments, seductive colour and all the 'real stuff'. Masters the UK Wedding Photographer of the Year 2019, Fearless Photographers Judge 2018, Fearless Conference Speaker 2019, ISPWP Top Wedding Photographer in the UK in 2017, 2018, 2019. Published author of the photo journal \"The Last Role 3: How to Save a Life\"."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:87
msgid "One of the best wedding photographers in China who likes capturing the candid moments of a wedding. He is honoured with countless accolades by various photography associations: Top 100 of WPJA in 2016, Top 50 of AG|WPJA in 2016, 2017 and Top 100 in 2018, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2018, Top 10 ISPWP Photographer in 2016, 2018, and the Grand Award of WPPI in 2018."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:88
msgid "Leonard is one of the top documentary wedding photographers in the Netherlands. Recognised with national and international awards, he has top rankings with The Masters of Wedding Photography, Fearless Photographers, WPJA and This is Reportage. His aim in documenting weddings is to help couples remember and relive their wedding the best way possible – even to a level that their memories are preserved as art."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:89
msgid "In his photos, he skillfully combines his personal shooting style, precise timing and emotional competence. Being a professional who is fascinated by everything that he does and sees around himself, he finds that people are a plentiful source of inspiration for him. He has twice been the finalist of the Mywed Award in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination."
msgstr "In his photos, he skillfully combines his personal shooting style, precise timing and emotional competence. Being a professional who is fascinated by everything that he does and sees around himself, he finds that people are a plentiful source of inspiration for him. He has twice been the finalist of the MyWed Award in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:90
msgid "A shy guy with a sharp eye, Andreu is a full-time observer and he is always striving to capture the authentic side of the story. He grew up in Barcelona and studied photography at Goldsmith University in London. Currently, he is one of the Top 10 photographers in Spain by FDB, Top 20 in the world by WPS and a 7 times finalist of the MyWed Award."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:91
msgid "A hotshot photographer from Mexico, Gustavo found his vocation while he was studying the career in cinematography. Passionate about travelling, horror movies, ramen and couple goals, he is the finalist of 4 nominations of the MyWed Award of the previous years and the \"Photographer of the year\" in 2018, famous for his vibrant, dynamic and emotionally charged photos."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:92
msgid "Top 3 Vietnam photographer on MyWed. Luan relishes in shooting ordinary people and finds real joy in their simple and peaceful yet, at the same time, exciting moments. Being a finalist of the MyWed Award 2018 in \"The Colour's Speech\" nomination, he is, quite literally, a true master of colour."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:93
msgid "A husband, a proud father of two beautiful girls and a photographer by passion. Pedro lives in Lisbon and spends his days leading a simple life surrounded by his family and friends, nice talks and vibes, good food and wine and always with a camera in his hand. Top 10 photographers in Portugal on MyWed."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:94
msgid "A quiet but an interesting guy, Artur loves photojournalism. He is considered to be one of the best wedding photographers in Germany, always eager for the perfect moment and shot. He adores travelling, delicious food and street photography. Happily married for more than 14 years, Artur is a father of two boys."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:121
msgid "Emil Boczek"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:122
msgid "Daniele Vertelli"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:123
msgid "Kemran Shiraliev"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:124
msgid "Albert Pamies"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:125
msgid "Xiang Qi"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:126
msgid "Denise Motz"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:127
msgid "Miguel Ponte"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:128
msgid "Jesse La Plante"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:129
msgid "Elena Flexas"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:131
msgid "A wedding photographer from China with 12 years of shooting experience. Creativity and documentary are his forte. Top-10 Wedding Photographers in the world by ISPWP in 2020–2021, Top 100 Wedding Photographers in the world by Fearless in 2016–2021, and 5-time finalist in the \"Photographer of the Year\" nomination of the MyWed Wedding Award. He has also been a jury member of several international photography competitions."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:132
msgid "Jesse La Plante is a Colorado-based photographer who has been shooting weddings since 2008. In 2021, he was named The XP Top 10, Fearless Top 50, WPJA Top 50 and ISPWP Top 100. When not photographing weddings, he can be found skiing, eating copious amounts of tacos and/or working on his beer belly at one of Colorado's many outstanding craft breweries."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:133
msgid "Albert is a Spanish photographer who shoots weddings all over the world and has been awarded in the last 10 years by the best international associations of wedding photographers such as Fearless and Inspiration Photographers among others. In 2019, he was ranked first in the world on MyWed thanks to a very careful aesthetic in his photography where light and composition not only add beauty but also contribute to a greater emotional impact."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:134
msgid "Daniele Vertelli has become the Photographer of the Year 2020 on MyWed, 2 times winner in AG|WPJA, grand award winner of the WPPI Album Division in 2017. He is titled the Best Italian Photographer 4 times and included in the Top10 ISPWP and Top10 Fearless Photographers. Daniele loves reality, unbuilt scenes and the light post productions, the soft and natural colors, but above all – the emotions."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:135
msgid "Miguel Ponte is recognized by many as one of the best Portuguese wedding photographers of the past few years. Winner of the MyWed Wedding Award 2018 in \"The Unexpected Twist\" category, and several times finalist in 2020. A panel of 30 judges of the Federation of European Photographers titled him as European Wedding Photographer of the Year in 2021. The same year, he was ranked 15th in the ISPWP Top 100, 6th in the Top 100 XP Photographers, and 5th in the Top 100 ProWed, which makes him one of the most consistent and well-rounded wedding photographers in the world."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:136
msgid "Emil is an award-winning documentary wedding photographer, currently living in the UK with his wife and three children. Recognized in various photography associations: Top 25 WPJA, Top 100 Fearless Photographers and This is Reportage, SLR Lounge UK Top 100 list. Nikon shooter since 1988."
msgstr "Emil is an award winning documentary wedding photographer, currently living in the UK with his wife and three children (and a cat). Recognized in various photography associations: Top 25 WPJA, Top 100 Fearless Photographers and This is Reportage, SLR Lounge UK Top 100 list. Nikon shooter since 1988. Likes a glass of good Scotch while editing weddings."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:137
msgid "Denise has a great passion for photojournalistic photography, in which emotions, art and humor play an important role. She is more than happy when she can travel, seek for adventure and document beautiful characters and their stories. Photographer of the Year 2020 FdB, Top 10 Masters of wedding photography BeNeLux 2021, finalist in 3 single-shot nominations and in the ‘Photographer of the Year' nomination of the MyWed Wedding Award 2020. Denise is an international speaker and uplifting mentor based in the Netherlands & Italy."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:138
msgid "A wedding photojournalist based in Mexico and interested to tell a real and natural story instead \"sure shots\". Finalist of the MyWed Wedding Award 2020 & 2021. Fearless awarded. Top 100 ISPWP 2020 & 2021. Top 100 This is Reportage 2020. Top 20 Inspiration Photographers and nominated to the Golden Lens Awards \"Revelation of the Year 2021\"."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:139
msgid "For 12 years of experience in photography, Kemran has shot more than 700 weddings. Original approach and an unconventional vision in photography helped him to win at various internet resources and contests for wedding photographers at certain periods of time. So, in 2016 and 2021, he became the Best Wedding Photographer by ISPWP, Top 10 Fearless Photographers in 2018 and 2021, Photographer of the Year 2021 by XP Photographers. Kemran has become finalist in the Wedding Award Russia, finalist and winner in several nominations of the MyWed Wedding Award. It is participation in the competitions that gives him the maximum motivation and even a sense of making sport of it. Currently, Kemran extensively shoots and teaches photography."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:141
msgid "Manish Patel"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:142
msgid "Meet Manish Patel, a talented photographer with a passion for capturing breathtaking moments. His artistic eye and keen attention to details make his photographs truly captivating, bringing life to every frame. He believes in hard-work, and delighted to have a wonderful experience of wedding photography from the last 24 years. MyWed Top 3 Best Wedding Photographers in India. Fearless Photographers Top 50 in India, Top 50 Worldwide in 2020, and 12-time contest Winner. Weddingsutra Photographer in 2021, award-winner in Wedding Ceremony and runner in 2020, and got bronze in Bridal Portrait nomination in Admired in Africa 2017. He has a team that is passionate about photography, designs and editing work, too. He has captured 1000+ weddings all over the world. His work never fails to leave a lasting impression on those who view it."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:143
msgid "Dan Morris"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:144
msgid "Dan Morris is a Cheltenham-based wedding photographer hailing from the UK. With a wanderlust for travel, he’s embarked on photographic journeys spanning across the UK and beyond, capturing the essence of love and celebration. His lens has witnessed over 350 beautiful ceremonies, encompassing both local and exotic destinations across 17 countries and 5 continents. A true devotee of the art, Dan thrives as a creative documentary photographer, seamlessly weaving candid moments with relaxed portraits. His affinity for street photography infuses a unique energy into the wedding captures, allowing him to embrace the raw, unfiltered emotions that unfold. He aims to be the unseen observer, unobtrusively immersing himself in the heart of the occasion, crafting a visual narrative that flows effortlessly."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:145
msgid "Daniele Torella"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:146
msgid "His cinematic yet emotional and spontaneous style has led him to photograph weddings around the world. Winner of several national and international awards, in 2022 he made the Top 10 of Fearless Photographers. His photographs are characterized by warm tones, always impeccable composition and creative use of natural light. For two years now, Daniele Torella has long been at the absolute top of MyWed's overall ranking ahead of more than 45,000 wedding photographers."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:147
msgid "Egor Zhelov"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:148
msgid "Egor is Top 10 wedding photographers in Russia and the most rugged photographer in Moscow. He prefers combining fancy reportage with a hint of madness, and hates boring weddings. Winner of the MyWed Award 2017 in the Heroes of the Day nomination. MyWed Award finalist in 2022, 2021, 2019, 2018. Egor also reached Top 150 best wedding photographers in the World by SLR Lounge 2016 and Top Fearless Photographers 2015."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:149
msgid "Giandomenico Cosentino"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:150
msgid "Giandomenico Cosentino is a photographer of Italian origins with over 15 years of experience in the wedding photography industry. In 2019 and 2021, he clinched the title of the best photographer in Italy, a testament to his dedication and skills. In 2021, Giandomenico achieved new significant milestones, placing himself in the Top 10 of renowned international associations such as Fearless and ISPWP. These accomplishments underscore his ongoing pursuit of artistic excellence and technical innovation. The following year, in 2022, he secured the Photographer of the Year title at the MyWed Wedding Award, further solidifying his reputation as an excellent photographer. Beyond awards and recognition, Giandomenico's artistry lies in his ability to capture genuine emotions and meaningful moments through his lens. Each photograph tells a story, a frozen fragment of life's beauty."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:151
msgid "Tana Gon"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:152
msgid "Tana is a wedding photographer based in Bangkok, Thailand. According to MyWed, he’s now ranked in Top 100 wedding photographers in the world and the best in Bangkok. In 2022, he received a wedding award from MyWed in the Transparency nomination. Partnering with Canon Thailand, he has previously hosted multiple workshops in different cities across the country. The events were to share his experiences as a wedding photographer and also to inspire others. Tana’s photography approach consists of combining documentary and aesthetics, as well as street style."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:153
msgid "Valter Antunes"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:154
msgid "He has been in the Top 10 Fearless Photographers for the past 3 years, was Photographer of the year in 2021 for This is Reportage and also won the Wedding Golden Camera for the FEP Photographer of the Year in 2020. These rewards make Valter one of the most titled photographers in the industry. His style is mainly documentary combined with creativity which often results in unusual real moments with a funny side to it."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:156
msgid "Jorge Romero is a Mexican photographer born in Guadalajara. He has had the opportunity to photograph more than 650 weddings and has given over 50 workshops. He has also shared his knowledge at more than 15 congresses around the world. Throughout his career, he has photographed more than 5 million pictures. In 2018, he was ranked Top 10 at ISPWP. He was also #1 MyWed Wedding Photographer for over a year and has received more than 600 Editor's Choice flags. Over the past 3 years, he has consistently been in the Top 25 at Fearless Photographers, one of the most important wedding photography websites in the world. He even reached #5 spot in 2021. He has served as a judge at different associations. His photos are based on capturing the moment at the right time while also considering composition and creativity. He would define himself as an architectural and landscape photographer who incorporates couples into photos."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:158
msgid "Alberto Cosenza"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:159
msgid "Alberto is an Italian photographer and narrator of wedding stories made of light and feelings. In love with art in all its forms, he feeds off the world around him and the people he meets through photography. With his pictorial and poetic photography, he creates true, intimate, and elegant wedding stories.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"He has won several competitions over the years, including the title Photographer of the Year in the MyWed Award 2023 and ANFM, the most essential Italian Wedding Photography Association.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Photography allows Alberto to observe, narrate, and convert his every thought into images, capturing the looks and souls of those in front of my camera and immortalizing their memories."
msgstr "Alberto is an Italian photographer and narrator of wedding stories made of light and feelings. In love with art in all its forms, he feeds off the world around him and the people he meets through photography. With his pictorial and poetic photography, he creates true, intimate, and elegant wedding stories.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"He has won several competitions over the years, including the title Photographer of the Year in the MyWed Award 2023 and ANFM, the most essential Italian Wedding Photography Association.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Photography allows Alberto to observe, narrate, and convert his every thought into images, capturing the looks and souls of those in front of his camera and immortalizing their memories."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:165
msgid "Sharon Dasht"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:166
msgid "Sharon Dasht is a Melbourne-based destination wedding photographer with years of experience and a deep commitment to her craft. Her work has been featured in esteemed publications like British Vogue and recognized among the top 10 wedding photographers in Australia on MyWed.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Her approach to photography hinges upon storytelling, where each image is crafted with care to reflect the genuine emotions of the day. Sharon is known for her gentle color tones, balanced composition, and thoughtful use of natural light, creating images that resonate with couples who seek a blend of candid moments and artfully composed portraits."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:169
msgid "Fabio Santos"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:170
msgid "We can start by saying that I am a happy person who lives life in a very simple and intense way. For me, the best in life is to enjoy every moment as if it were the last.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"I put all my genuineness, creativity, vision, and thought into all my shots. I am currently part of the World's Top 10 and the Best Photographer in Portugal on MyWed. I have already won several awards in photography over the years and was a finalist for the MyWed Award 2022. I was also a finalist and winner in several nominations for the MyWed Award 2023."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:174
msgid "Marius Tudor"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:175
msgid "Wedding, sports, and documentary photography, curiosity, openness to the unknown, and knowledge have guided me on a journey of over 14 years in the world of image creation. I love candid photography, and rather than moving elements into the frame, I prefer to move myself.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"See you around!"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:179
msgid "Bárbara Torres"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:180
msgid "My name is Barbara Torres. I have liked photography since I was a little girl; my grandfather and my mother used to practice this profession, so I was pretty close to this world. However, when I had to decide what career I should study, my mother suggested choosing nutrition. Still, I realized that I had always wanted to do wedding photography.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Therefore, when I finished my nutrition degree, I began to study photography. It was not until 2015 that I decided to dedicate myself to this beautiful profession. I am truly happy that I made the right decision. Photography has led me to discover incredible people and places. I firmly believe that photos make us live those beautiful moments again.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Disney is the reason I want my wedding photos to look like a fairy tale. I love everything at a wedding, and if there is tequila, much more! I think my inspiration comes from very random places and things, from colors to flowers' textures, even from an exotic dessert or movie magic."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:186
msgid "Eshant Raju"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:187
msgid "I'm passionate about capturing life's precious moments and crafting them into compelling narratives. My diverse photography style encompasses candid, documentary, street, landscape, portraiture, weddings, and wildlife genres. Wedding photography holds a special place in my heart, as it enables me to connect with new individuals and families, each with their unique stories and experiences.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Through my travels and encounters with people from different cultures, I've gained a distinct perspective on storytelling. This journey has been incredibly rewarding, and I eagerly anticipate continuing to cherish and share these moments."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:191
msgid "William Lambelet"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:192
msgid "At a very young age, William developed a passion for photojournalism. Self-taught, he quickly launched his career as a professional freelance photographer in 2009. Today, his business is divided into three parts.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Wedding photography with a photojournalistic approach. His work has regularly won international awards. William has twice been named the \"World's Best Wedding Photojournalist\" by the WPJA, in 2017 and 2021.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Training of professional photographers. He organizes various workshops and events around wedding photography and its evolution.<br>\n"
"<br>\n"
"Since 2020, a photojournalist for the press. William has collaborated with famous magazines such as \"La Croix\", \"Les Echos\", and \"Le Monde des Ados.\""
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:200
msgid "Antonio Palermo"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:201
msgid "Technique, expression and emotion are the fundamental pillars of my work. Each shot is designed to tell a story, to convey the feelings and atmospheres that permeate the day. I consider myself an invisible storyteller, moving discreetly among the guests, observing and documenting the small details and big emotions without ever interfering. Tears of joy, affectionate hugs, spontaneous laughter and complicit glances are captured naturally, creating a visual narrative that goes beyond the superficial.\n"
"<br>\n"
"MyWed Award 2023\n"
"Finalist in the category of \"Photographer of the Year\"\n"
"<br>\n"
"Inspiration Photographers: Winner 3 \"Golden Lens Awards 2024\"\n"
"- 1st Most Awarded Wedding Photographer Of The Year\n"
"- Wedding Collection Of The Year\n"
"- Wedding Photographer Revelation Of The Year\n"
"<br>\n"
"This Is Reportage 2023: Photographer of the Year winner (Italy)\n"
"<br>\n"
"Fearless: 2023/24: Top 10 Fearless Reportage Wedding Photographer\n"
"<br>\n"
"ISPWP 2022: Top 10 Wedding Photographers in the World."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:216
msgid "Gowtham Vijay"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:217
msgid "I'm Gowtham Vijay, a photographer from Tamil Nadu, India. Born in one of the smallest villages you can imagine, the kind that doesn't even have a bus stop.\n"
"In 2018, I accidentally stepped into the world of wedding photography. What started as a simple curiosity soon became my life's passion.\n"
"I'm drawn to the quiet glances, raw emotions, and in-between moments that tell the wedding's real story.\n"
"My work focuses on capturing these timeless memories with a cinematic, soulful approach, turning fleeting moments into something unforgettable."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:221
msgid "Sasha Titov"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:222
msgid "Over 10 years in wedding photography. Drawn to telling real stories rather than just showing them. Inspired by nature, cinematography and finding magic in simple things. Fueled by curiosity, and always chasing the next adventure. Believes a camera is for exploring and, for sure, nothing needs to be taken too seriously."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:223
msgid "Benjamin Monge"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:224
msgid "Benjamín Monge, documentary wedding photographer from Concepción. In 2018 he left his career in the industrial area to devote himself fully to his passion: photography.\n"
"<br>\n"
"He has become a reference in the documentary style, where minimalism and elegance are always the protagonists.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Traveling around Chile and the world telling stories, thanks to this, his photographs and reports have led him to become the number 1 photographer in Chile and to be in the top 30 worldwide in MyWed.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Benjamin truly believes that an amazing photographer is not made by years of experience, but by the passion put into each photograph."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:231
msgid "Igor Sazonov"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:232
msgid "I'm interested in weddings that have a balance of everything that is important, valuable and interesting to me. This is something with meaning, deeper... more than just about love.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Live cinematic photography with elements of unusual soulful staging. At the center of my shots are the relationships, feelings and emotions of the protagonists (couple) and characters (their friends and family). I try to integrate something \"fresh\" in the world of photography, but not to change myself within my style.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Winner of the MyWed Award 2024 in the Wedding Guests category\n"
"<br>\n"
"Finalist of Wedding Awards 2023 (Russia) in the category \"Best Reportage Wedding Photographer\".\n"
"<br>\n"
"Top 5 best photographers of Russia rating top100awards (2022)."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:241
msgid "Christian Goenaga"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:242
msgid "I'm a Colombian wedding photographer with over 12 years of experience, passionate about telling stories through my images. I love working with natural light and capturing genuine moments. For me, photography is a language — a way to communicate a message that can be \"heard” through the eyes in the most beautiful and thoughtful way possible.\n"
"<br>\n"
"In 2016, I was named Breakthrough Photographer of the Year in my country. In 2018, Nikon Pro Magazine in London recognized me as an emerging artist in the new wave of photography. In 2024, I was honored to be selected by MyWed as one of the Top 10 Photographers of the Year, and in 2025, I proudly serve as a jury member for this incredible competition.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Photography has opened doors for me, taken me across countries, and brought me thousands of smiles. I love what I do."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:247
msgid "Sergio Lopez"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:248
msgid "Photography is our choice, our way, a way to feel, to move and to transmit, and you don't study it, you live it!\n"
"To do this you have to connect with what is happening around you, be part of it, feel and be moved yourself first, and finally with an instinctive impulse to shoot..."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:250
msgid "Alexander Ziegler"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:251
msgid "Alex is a proud father, globetrotter and documentary photographer based between Germany and Spain. For over a decade, he has been capturing weddings in a pure documentary and candid style. With a background in Visual Journalism from Hanover University of Applied Sciences and Arts, where he studied under some of the world's leading photojournalists, he developed his way of telling authentic stories about people, traditions and community life.\n"
"<br>\n"
"His approach breaks away from typical wedding industry clichés, earning him numerous awards, recognition from major international associations, and invitations to serve as a juror at several photography competitions. Outside the wedding season, he loves to travel and continues to pursue personal documentary projects."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:254
msgid "Hollie Mateer"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:255
msgid "A photographer from Yorkshire has become the first in the world to win Wedding Photographer of the Year and Family Photographer of the Year in the international This Is Reportage Awards.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Hollie said: \"My passion is photography – getting to do it as a job makes me feel so lucky. For a long time, I had imposter syndrome. It's such a huge honour to be chosen to capture the biggest day of a couple's life but it can also be pretty intimidating, especially when you're starting out as a young female photographer.\n"
"<br>\n"
"\"I've learned to overcome this by creating authentic work that speaks about me as an artist and a person. I feel very blessed to be recognised by international industry professionals but it is the wonderful feedback from my clients that really fills me with pride. Many of the couples whose weddings I photograph get back in touch to ask me to take their family photos. I've also done it the other way round where I've photographed a family and later the wedding.\""
msgstr ""

